    <briefdescription>
<para>The map maintains the list of imports. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Conceptually, it is a collection of tuples of the form:</para>
<para>(The name of the source module, GUID, Definition/Declaration)</para>
<para>The name of the source module is the module identifier to pass to the ModuleLoader. The module identifier strings must be owned elsewhere, typically by the in-memory <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_summary_index" kindref="compound">ModuleSummaryIndex</ref> the importing decisions are made from (the module path for each summary is owned by the index&apos;s module path string table). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
